								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14609#msg14609">Quote from: Colleen on February 15, 2005, 08:57:55 pm</a></div><div class="quote">This whole expansion is  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bullshit.gif" alt="Bull Shit!" border="0" /><br /></div><br />That about sums it all up right there. Bazaar is screwed, new barter area looks like crap, new zones arent accessable and everything is looks like the aftermath of one of Kinladars College Partys...no orffense
