							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />[57 Paladin] Naithein (High Elf) - Rodcet Nife <br />[54 Druid] Naithien (Wood Elf) - Rodcet Nife<br />[43 Monk] Spankii (Human) - Rodcet Nife
