	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14613"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792" title="View the profile of Colleen">Colleen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 121<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14613#msg14613"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14613#msg14613">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> February 15, 2005, 09:45:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Okay I now know that you need to do a quest to access DON sorta like GOD which sucks ass anyway. Here is some of it you guys fill in the rest as needed.<br /><br /><br /><br />You go to ak&quot;anon and to to this chic on a dock and hail her You recieve a bag, You get another Quest. You need to do alot of subquests which she tells you about then&nbsp; I believe you need 1 raw diamond 1 star ruby 1 fire opal and Fuzzle Formula 5000 for a weary scavenger to give to Trang in POT for DON Access. Fill in the blank if I have missed anything.. I stll paid lots of money and I ahve to quest to enter it&nbsp; JEEZ!<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14615"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202" title="View the profile of xaanru">xaanru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 80<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m not a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14615#msg14615"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14615#msg14615">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> February 15, 2005, 10:14:17 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I believe you need 1 raw diamond 1 star ruby 1 fire opal and Fuzzle Formula 5000 for a weary scavenger to give to Trang in POT for DON Access.</div><br />Ok, you need three storebought items, and one common drop from any PoP or newer zone. How&nbsp; horrid. It should be easy, like the quest I have almost completed to get my VP key. But then, after all, that only lets me in ONE zone, with drops that apparently are similar to the tradeskill gear from the new expansion.<br /><br />Personally, I&#039;ll reserve judgement of this expansion, until AFTER I have had a chance to check it out.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
