								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14654#msg14654"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14654#msg14654">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> February 16, 2005, 10:18:17 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Everything I&#039;ve seen about DoN looks promising, and Oow was an excellent expansion by all accounts.  I&#039;ll reserve judgment until I&#039;ve actually gotten a chance to explore, though.<br /><br />Combining the bazaar with an arena was always goofy.  PvP in the laggiest zone of the game, great idea!  I always thought there should be an arena next door in shadowhaven, instead, or just have a teleporter directly to the Lake Rathe arena (best arena by far, but too far to run to for a quick fight).  
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
