							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I never had lag problems in the arena, i guess cause the arena is off to another side.. i hate that they took the arena away :(<br />The lay out of the bazaar seems better for lag, but annoying to port back and forth, we need to pick red or blue, everyone&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> <br />that Dragon was so cool, and it was fun to watch Callon die /tease&nbsp; =oP. cant wait to get home, i&nbsp; am loving this expansion so far.<br /><br />back to school now&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bitching.gif" alt="Bitching" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
